WEBVTT

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.410
Is Creed alive?

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.710
Calm down, Train!

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.380
He is alive...

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.380
and, Black Cat,

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.720
he wants very much to see you.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:33.050
Where is he!?

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:37.730
If you want to see him, I suggest you
come to Sangeles City in three days.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.060
I'll be there, too!

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.400
What do you mean!?

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.730
A wonderful festival will start there.

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.790
Please bring your friends with you, too.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:51.740
--Well, then...
--See ya!

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:53.140
Wait!

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.440
Train!

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:15.700
Sangeles... City...

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.390
Train...

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.040
Sven, it's torn up...

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:26.200
Aahh! The rental dress is!

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:32.710
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:39.880
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:59.010
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:05.350
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:11.690
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:18.030
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:24.530
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:31.040
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:34.040
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:44.040
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:57.330 --> 00:03:00.960
"Reckless Cat"

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:14.350
I see nothing
particularly unusual, Jenos-<i>sama.</i>

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:16.680
When there's something unusual,
we'll be in trouble.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:19.850
But why are you, one of the Numbers,

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:21.350
doing a task like security
for the Summit, Jenos-<i>sama</i>?

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:25.190
There're several things that
I'm concerned about... Hmm?

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:28.720
What's the matter?

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:34.030
She's such a cutie!

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:37.030
Y- yeah...

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:44.380
Here in Sangeles City, under tight security,
the Continental Summit is about to start.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:46.980
Leaders from each country all convene

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:50.010
to explore the possibility
of a continental union,

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:52.050
and this Summit is
drawing citizens' attention.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:55.390
In addition, there have
also been some credible rumors,

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:57.050
such as that there
will be a terrorist attack.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:59.390
This looks as if the
city's under martial law.

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:03.660
They're probably showing off their military
power to intimidate surrounding countries,

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:08.330
though the fact is that they can't take care
of their own country without Chronos.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:13.670
What does that guy with the hat want to
show us by calling us to a place like this?

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:16.670
He said a festival'd start,
or something like that, right?

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:19.340
I wonder if we can see fireworks.

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:22.010
Seems like this'll be a
different kind of festival.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.910
That's no fun.

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:28.020
I wonder if it has something
to do with the Summit.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:31.690
I don't know. That aside,
I'm worried about Train...

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:37.700
As soon as he heard the name "Creed",
he disappeared on us.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:42.030
A man connected to Train's past, huh?

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:44.040
I have a bad feeling...

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.700
When Train and that Creed guy
face each other,

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:49.370
something bad's definitely gonna happen.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:52.040
So, you got worried
and came after him, huh?

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.380
Hell no!

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:57.050
I have to pay for the rental dress
that got tore up the other day...

00:04:57.050 --> 00:05:00.650
and, well, big cities have more
wanted criminals with higher rewards...

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.320
I know what you're thinking.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:07.660
Since I looked into that eye of yours.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:11.660
Honestly, that guy's
really high-maintenance...

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.660
Hey, what're you doing here!?

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:17.360
Pursuing that duo led me here.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:27.010
No! I'm not some woman
that'll do whatever you want.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:30.350
--Echidna-<i>san's</i> pretty.
--Please stay here forever.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:31.680
I need you.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:34.020
Let's get going.

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:35.690
Is it time already?

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:37.690
Yes.

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:40.020
Do you think Kuro-<i>sama'll</i> come?

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.030
Kuro-<i>sama</i>?

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:43.360
He's Black Cat, so Kuro-<i>sama.</i>

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.030
I see...

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:50.700
Why did you invite Kuro-<i>sama</i>
to our festival, Charden-<i>san</i>?

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.700
Because Creed wanted to see him.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:58.380
Also, I sensed that he
has the same aura as ours.

00:05:58.380 --> 00:05:59.710
Really?

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.310
It's the aura of a lonely soul.

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:03.650
Hmm...

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:08.650
So, he may empathize with the goal
of the Apostles of the Stars.

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:12.320
Then, Kuro-<i>sama</i> and I can fight together!?

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:14.990
It'd be great if that happens...

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:18.000
Why must you go now!?

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.670
The die is already cast.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:23.330
So, it'll start at last, Creed...

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.670
Yeah, our festival will...

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:31.010
Look at those fools, Echidna.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:33.940
They don't know times have changed.

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:36.680
Are we ready?

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:40.520
Yes. Everyone's waiting for your signal.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:44.690
We'll engrave today in history...

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:46.660
as the day that we,
the Apostles of the Stars,

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:49.630
took a grand step forward into the world.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:59.330
It seems that the sacrifice to
bless our departure has appeared.

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:02.970
Oh?

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:04.670
That's...

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:08.310
Echidna Parass!!

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:12.320
I'm a big fan of hers!
Maybe I should get her autograph?

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.320
Yeah...

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.320
Hmm?

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:16.990
There's someone else.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.050
Creed Diskenth!

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.900
So, he's finally made a move.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.340
Hmm? What the hell is that?

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:41.010
Hey, what're you doing there!?

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:42.350
You small fries!

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.680
What!?

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:50.690
I'm the gunman from the
Apostles of the Stars, Durham.

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:52.160
Remember that.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.360
Roger! We'll immediately
head to District Y-13.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:58.030
Y-13. Hurry up.

00:07:58.030 --> 00:08:00.630
Yes, sir!

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:01.970
What's the matter?

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:03.630
Seems like it's broken down.

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:05.640
What's wrong?

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:06.640
My body...

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:07.800
Heavy...

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:15.280
Wh- what's this heaviness?

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:21.080
A-are you doing this, you bastard?

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:25.150
"Bastard"?

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:32.860
How rude. I, Maro, am a descendent
of noble blood from Itairiku.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.670
Hey, kid! What're you doing there?

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:44.010
Are you alone, sonny?

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:46.680
It's dangerous to be in a place like this.

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:51.020
Yeah, it surely will be dangerous...
if you come close to me.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:56.690
Now, if you walk around alone at a time
like this and get hurt, your mom'll...

00:08:56.690 --> 00:08:58.020
What's the matter?

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:01.290
C- can't breathe...

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:05.860
See I told you... that it'd be
dangerous if you came close to me.

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.630
Who... are you?

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:12.970
Oh? You point a gun at a child?

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:15.640
What a horrible police officer.

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:17.900
An adult like that should be...

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:27.320
You asked me who I am?

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:28.990
I'm Leon.

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:31.820
I'm a Taoist, who controls the air at will.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:36.990
What in the world is happening!?
I can hear explosions.

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:40.660
Various unconfirmed information is
swirling around and the city is in tumult.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:44.000
City residents, please keep calm
and evacuate to a safe place.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.000
It's them! No doubt about it!

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:48.010
Wait. Where're you going?

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:49.340
I'll go bring back Train.

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:52.680
Even though you don't know where he is?

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.350
In any case, I have no choice
but to look for him, right!?

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:56.110
How!?

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:59.020
In the meantime at this
Presidential Office Building,

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:02.690
the Summit is about to start
in this tumultuous environment.

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:06.820
This is 207. We're currently
heading toward District 12. Over.

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:10.590
Smooch!

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:17.370
It melted!

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:19.040
Wh- what the...

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:21.370
That's not good, Kyoko-<i>san.</i>

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:24.870
You have to be more merciless
when you fight.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:34.450
They're monsters!

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:42.060
I came as promised.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.390
Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:45.020
Where's Creed!?

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.350
Everyone, please don't worry.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:11.690
It seems that a trivial squabble
has happened near the premises.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.680
Our military should suppress it soo...

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.030
That's...

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.370
Yeah, no doubt about it...

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.200
But what is she doing
in a place like this?

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:35.570
Y- you're Echidna Parass!

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.360
Wh- what on earth...

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:58.400
Let me introduce you to Creed Diskenth.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:01.870
He's the leader of the
"Apostles of the Stars",

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:04.340
which will carve out
a new history for this planet.

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:07.010
The "Apostles of the Stars" she said?

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:08.680
Precisely.

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:13.640
We're a group of wise people who will
take your place and rule the world.

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:16.180
That's no use.

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:29.130
Wh- what do you want?

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:32.830
For you to die.

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:39.870
Kuro-<i>sama</i>! You came!

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:43.710
Bring Creed here.

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:45.380
Kuro-<i>sama...</i>

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:47.720
You don't have to be hasty.
You'll see him soon.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:51.060
I've got no time to wait around.

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:54.460
Look around calmly.

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:11.680
How about that? Was it to your liking?

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:14.340
These are fireworks for the festival.

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:18.180
Freeing people from utterly dirty rulers...

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:22.520
It is an obligation for those with power
to correct this corrupt world

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.360
and return it to its old self...

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:28.030
I want to see Creed, now!

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:30.360
You're such a hasty man.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:32.700
Okay, then. It's time.

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:34.130
Okay.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.660
That's...

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:08.960
Creed!

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:15.670
J- just now, the Presidential Office Building
has collapsed before my eyes!

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:18.340
What on earth is happening!?

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:21.010
Oh! Is that a human figure?

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:25.140
From the cloud of dust,
a survivor appears, or...

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:29.020
Hello, Train. Long time no see.

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:30.020
What!?

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:33.690
Did you see it... my power?

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:39.360
I'm very excited to hear
that you're in this town.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:41.030
Hey, what're you gonna do!?

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:42.370
What else!?

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.930
I'm gonna stop Train!!

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:47.900
Sven...

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:08.760
Train!

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:20.670
Let me introduce you...

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:23.110
We're the "Apostles of the Stars"!!

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:28.350
Congratulations, Train.

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:33.350
You made it on time for the
Apostles of the Stars' memorable day.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:36.910
Now, it's time for you to join me and...

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:42.690
Why did you kill Saya?

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:45.360
That look! That look in your eyes!

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:48.030
That's the same hate-filled look
from those days!

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:51.700
It was worth killing that witch.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.730
Don't mess with me!!

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:06.580
It's no use, Train.

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.010
T-... Train!

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:36.010
Stop, Train!! You'll die!!

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:40.020
You can't compete with me
with your current abilities.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:42.020
But don't worry.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:45.020
If you obtain the power of Tao,
you, too, will...

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:48.420
You bastard, I'll make you pay!!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.640
That's my Train!

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:04.980
But sadly it's pointless.
I'm not the same Creed from before.

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:06.640
You...

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:10.650
This is the power of Tao.
It's wonderful, isn't it?

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:12.650
If you join us, too,
you'll get this power...

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:14.910
That's disgusting!

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:20.320
It's heavy, isn't it?

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:24.330
That gun weighs over 200kg right now.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:27.660
Take this! Bind to Earth Curse!

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:31.340
Now, come with me, Train.

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:34.170
Who'd go... with you...

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:37.340
You really are...

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:38.500
Train!!

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:45.350
Idiot! Why'd you come!?

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.680
Who the hell are you?

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:51.360
Are you trying to interfere
with my reunion with Train!?

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:53.650
<i>It wasn't a sword. It was by a gun...</i>

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:06.300
Sven!

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:08.640
Hey!

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:10.270
Sven!

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:14.640
Durham, <i>you</i>!!

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:17.010
Why did you shoot!?

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:24.950
I'm sorry, Train, for ruining the banquet
of our long-waited reunion...

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:33.260
For today, I'll settle for the fact
that I was able to see you...

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:43.340
Looks like a worthless bunch
sprouted around you again...

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:45.670
I won't give up.

00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:52.020
You'll surely come to me... Surely...

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.570
Stop right there!

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.020
What're you doing!? Let me go!

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:59.690
Give it up! He's beyond your power!

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:02.490
Creed!!!

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:17.310
You, son of a bitch! Why did you stop me!?

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:20.640
Enough with your recklessness!!
Are you trying to get yourself killed!?

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:23.740
It's my life! That's none of your busi...

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:33.660
Don't act like someone living on his own!!

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:34.890
Sven!

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:49.770
How long do you plan to pout like that?

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:56.350
Your were reckless, caused others trouble
and ended up getting punched...

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:58.040
How's it feel?

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:06.250
It's stupid of Sven to have risked
his own life for someone like you...

00:20:07.360 --> 00:20:12.360
I've looked into Sven's Vision Eye...

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:16.700
7 years ago, when Sven
was still an IBI agent,

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:19.700
he had a partner named Loyd.

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:22.710
Sven was very attached to him,

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:25.900
and always worked on cases
together with him.

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:32.380
But, on Loyd's daughter's birthday,
since he didn't want to disturb that,

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:36.720
he went to the hiding place
of a vicious criminal alone...

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:37.980
But...

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:44.720
Loyd!!

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:53.400
...the one who was shot was Loyd,
who wasn't supposed to be there.

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:55.740
He had the ability to see the future,

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:58.440
so, he predicted Sven's crisis.

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:05.020
That's right, Sven's Vision Eye
is Loyd's memento.

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:09.010
It's a past too serious
for that frivolous man.

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:32.380
I'm hungry.

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:34.040
What?

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:35.710
I won't ask too much.

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:38.720
Bacon and eggs, bread, and milk.

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:42.050
And, if a salad comes with that too,
that'd be perfect.

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:43.490
Okay?

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:48.390
Seems like you need more punches.

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:50.390
Hey, it hurts!

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:55.400
Shut up! Compared to the pain
in my heart, that's nothing!

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:58.270
Ahh! You hit a wounded person?

00:21:59.400 --> 00:22:01.340
Don't fool with... What the!

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:03.670
You bastard!

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:10.040
--Are they stupid?
--Are they stupid?

00:22:11.610 --> 00:22:16.520
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:20.520
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:26.290
<i>Please stop time tonight!</i>

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:41.210
<i>Please show yourself,</i>
<i>even if just a little</i>

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:44.480
<i>Around the time</i>
<i>the first evening star appears,</i>

00:22:44.480 --> 00:22:46.980
<i>I hear footsteps approaching</i>

00:22:46.980 --> 00:22:52.890
<i>The only time I can see you</i>
<i>is when the moon is shining</i>

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:55.890
<i>Please let me dream a little</i>

00:22:55.890 --> 00:22:59.130
<i>'Cause it'll become</i>
<i>an illusion by morning</i>

00:22:59.130 --> 00:23:02.500
<i>Even though I know it,</i>
<i>I still feel lonely</i>

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:08.170
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:14.180
<i>You held me in your arms</i>
<i>and your passionate lips met mine</i>

00:23:14.180 --> 00:23:17.180
<i>Please don't let go of me</i>

00:23:17.180 --> 00:23:20.520
<i>I'm about to melt in your arms</i>

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:23.350
<i>But morning is almost here</i>

00:23:23.350 --> 00:23:26.850
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:23:26.850 --> 00:23:33.190
<i>I pray to you,</i>
<i>please stop time</i>

00:23:40.670 --> 00:23:41.700
"Next Episode"

00:23:41.700 --> 00:23:43.600
<i>Since Creed appeared,</i>
<i>Train's been acting strange.</i>
"Next Episode"

00:23:43.600 --> 00:23:45.710
<i>Since Creed appeared,</i>
<i>Train's been acting strange.</i>

00:23:45.710 --> 00:23:47.680
<i>Even when we ask him</i>
<i>if there's a serious reason,</i>

00:23:47.680 --> 00:23:50.710
<i>he only dodges the subject.</i>

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:53.380
<i>For now, he continues to travel</i>
<i>as if nothing had happened.</i>

00:23:53.380 --> 00:23:55.720
<i>But he's definitely planning something.</i>

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:59.390
<i>Train, what on earth are you planning?</i>

00:23:59.390 --> 00:24:00.660
<i>I don't care what it is,</i>

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:02.620
<i>but if you cause Sven to get hurt again,</i>

00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:04.560
"Lying Cat"
<i>I won't forgive you.</i>

00:24:04.560 --> 00:24:05.580
"Lying Cat"
